# Build context hygiene. The context is services/detection; the image needs
# fallcore/, v2/, service/, requirements.txt and scripts/fetch_weights.py.
# Everything here is either huge (the venvs, runs/, data/, models/), generated,
# or not part of the image. models/ and runs/ stay out on purpose: the build
# fetches its own weights, and .env reaches it as a secret, not as context.
.git
.gitignore
.dockerignore
.venv/
.venv-train/
**/.venv/
**/.venv-train/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.env
spool/
models/
runs/
data/
videos/
v2/fall_clips/
v2/videos/
tests/
.pytest_cache/
**/README.md
pyproject.toml
.env.example
